    "descriptionZh": "约 80 个无障碍优先的 React 19 组件，全部视觉（颜色、间距、字型、圆角、阴影、动效）通过一套与框架无关的 CSS token 契约控制，改一页 CSS 就能整体换肤。",
    "takeawayZh": "一条命令装 ~80 个可换肤的 React 19 组件",
    "noteZh": "About 栏直接写 No description, website, or topics provided.，右侧只有 MIT license 和 0 stars。README 的小标题排得很密：Why this over another React component library?、Theming & reskinning the whole library、Forms — headless useForm、Router adapter — wire your router once、Auth gating — headless RequireAuth、RSC / Server Components、Subpath imports for tree-shaking。开头一句是 ~80 accessibility-first React 19 components you re-skin from ~1 page of CSS。文件区里 src、docs、site、bugs、memory 并列，提交信息里能看到 Floating panels: leave the dialog's clip via the top layer (fixes #506)。",
